      "sourceText": "当前实物、仿真的 `FollowPath.enable_rotation` 都是 False，普通路径跟踪时该控制器自身给出的导航角速度为0。因此尚未改自旋设置时，实物默认不附加自旋，仿真默认附加3.14 rad/s，约每2秒一圈。Nav2恢复旋转等行为另有指令来源，速度平滑器也可能保留过渡过程，不能推成整个导航链永远只输出0角速度。",
      "translatedText": "Currently, both the real robot and simulation `FollowPath.enable_rotation` are False\\. During normal path tracking, the navigation angular velocity output by this controller itself is 0\\. Therefore, before the spin setting has been changed, by default the real robot does not add spin, while the simulation adds 3\\.14 rad/s by default, about one revolution every 2 seconds\\. Nav2's behaviors such as recovery rotation have other command sources, and the velocity smoother may also retain transition processes, so it cannot be inferred that the entire navigation chain will always output only 0 angular velocity\\.",
